OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity approves controversial
OL,4,Asavings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial restructuring plan that
OL,7,Fhas led to a series of strikes has been
OL,8,Fapproved by the University of
OL,9,FNottingham.
OL,11,FThe Future Nottingham programme has
OL,12,Fbeen formulated because financial
OL,13,Fpressures meant the institution's
OL,14,Flong-term prospects were
OL,15,F"unsustainable", officials said.
OL,17,FIt will see an unconfirmed number of
OL,18,Fjob losses, the closure of the modern
OL,19,Flanguages and music degrees, a
OL,20,Fstreamlining of support services and
OL,21,Fthe ending of traditional one-to-one
OL,22,Fpersonal tutoring.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
