OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity approves controversial
OL,4,Asavings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,7,Fis already carrying out solid strike
OL,8,Faction from today to 11 December, and
OL,9,Fsaid it was considering more if
OL,10,Fmanagers did not return to
OL,11,Fnegotiations.
